and the grep-unavailable AUTO-FALLBACK rule.

**Partial Rule Loading:** If SOME rules load and SOME fail, Gate 3 = PASS (`[x]`)
and CONTINUE. Only mark Gate 3 FAILED when ALL matched rules fail. Full rule +
worked example: "Partial Rule Loading" in {{rules_path}}/002n-agent-protocol-reference.md.

